Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yhibi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.48,0:00:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamu, Yamu, Yamu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,King arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, how can you still\Nbe on your brother's side?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He betrayed you to control Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.05,0:01:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I would stand by my\Nbrother no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're family, and nothing's\Ngoing to separate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after everything I've\Nshown him from his past,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.13,0:01:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,all of those times Seto mistreated him,\Nand he's still being loyal to his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.93,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of Seto getting everything\Nand leaving me with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.91,0:01:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserve to have what he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.31,0:01:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll start with his little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.07,0:01:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll make sure that\NMokuba is loyal to me instead of Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.87,0:01:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush him by taking the one thing he\Nthought he'd never lose: Mokuba's trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think your brother's\Nthinking right now? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you honestly believe\Nyour brother is coming to rescue you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is he glad you're out of\Nhis way once and for all?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto's definitely coming here to get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.37,0:02:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And when he does, you'll be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't you ask him yourself,\Nbecause he's right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.13,0:02:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.89,0:02:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take another step, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a\Nseat, you little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick and tired of you\Nalways holding me back, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault we're still stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back! Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't leave me here with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.69,0:02:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.77,0:02:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like your so-called brother\Ncouldn't care less where you end up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.25,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I, on the other hand,\Nwould like to help you, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see that you're\Ndifferent from the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.45,0:02:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.69,0:03:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, but you're the\None who trapped me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.65,0:03:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,i didn't do anything i'm\Nyour friend zetto is your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,enemy not me i am the\Nonly one in this world you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,can trust mokuba you're\Nthe only one i can trust
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,awesome kaiba crushed the\Nlast member of the Big five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.05,0:03:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have won your duel, but\Nyou've lost something more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a hint. Just look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The road's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.51,0:03:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed ahead and you may find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.43,0:03:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.73,0:03:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay out of this, Yugi. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't concern you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.73,0:04:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose your body for all we\Ncare, you stuck-up jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're better off without\Nhim anyway, right, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye and good riddance, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We should help him save Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and if he finds Noah, then\Nhe might find my body. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Following Kaiba may be the\Nonly way to save Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallelujah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.73,0:04:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd believe it's\Nreally me trapped in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can always count on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For all we know, you're Noah's pet baboon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let Kaiba go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.73,0:04:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So now what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go in there\Nand help Kaiba find Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No can do, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of helping Kaiba and\Nnot getting any thank yous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:05:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were in trouble, Kaiba\Nwould never go in after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, guys, suit yourself. Hey, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my own sister won't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.87,0:05:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Hey-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Mokuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known this wouldn't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of your tricks, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, help me! Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, is that you over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.53,0:06:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, what have you done with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to flip a coin? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He went this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.73,0:06:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your legs are longer than mine, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's a light ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that means we chose the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's some kind of an\Nold mansion or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.99,0:06:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever this place is, someone\Ndoesn't want us going in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:07:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you hear what I hear? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.05,0:07:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's some kind of virtual nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what if that baby is all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get in there and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My patience is growing thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.33,0:07:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting is not something I enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.85,0:07:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I must obtain Little\NYugi's Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and the two remaining Egyptian God Cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time I took matters\Ninto my own hands again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me, or did it just get foggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like fog to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.19,0:07:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the virtual fun\Nnever ends in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:07:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just dying to see what surprise\NNoah has in store for us next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thanks for dropping in, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, where's my little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand that you bring him, Okuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Seto, your little brother\Nis safe and sound thanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who took him\Nfrom me in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.29,0:08:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't know what kind of\Nstunt you're trying to pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hand him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.51,0:08:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your ex-employee Nesbitt\Ndisguised as Tristan who took Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should have\Nbeen a better boss, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.99,0:08:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it was me who saved\NMokuba from the Big Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be thanking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mokuba. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:08:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:08:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Go without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You just stood there and watched\Nwhile they took me away, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.47,0:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, what did you say to my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of lies did you\Npoison his brain with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not one, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba realized how little you\Ncare about him all by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.85,0:09:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe you should take\Nhis advice and just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll take more than\Nshouting to erase all of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.73,0:09:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,those painful memories\Nfrom your brother's mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of all those times\Nyou abandoned him just
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so you could achieve\Nyour own selfish goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never treated Mokuba like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Must you raise your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.33,0:09:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to Noah's lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to drive us apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done enough. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him hurt\Nyou anymore. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is not one of\Nyour sick games, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.83,0:10:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not destroy\Nthe only family I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all alone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that Mokuba\Nwould rather be my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's not the only thing\NI'll take from you. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned, you don't\Ndeserve anything that you have now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll make sure your\Npossessions go to someone who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.37,0:10:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And who deserves to have what's mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.77,0:10:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, I still hear it, but\Nthere's not a baby in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.27,0:10:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's getting louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.37,0:10:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got to be coming\Nfrom one of these rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No babies in here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.53,0:10:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Another empty room. This place\Nseems to be deserted. Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I found something. It's a rattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be crying too If I were stuck in a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.81,0:11:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,creepy old house With\Nno rattle You know what,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's really a\Nbaby In this place at all, Taya
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who's crying Unless\Nit's just a digital sound
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,file that's part of Noah's\Nfreaky virtual universe! Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a picture of someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This might tell us where we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.97,0:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So who's in the snapshot, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird! What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are all these contraptions?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And where are those fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.09,0:11:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,A locked door is always\Na good place to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You have entered an invalid password.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.89,0:11:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Entrance denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no patience for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Being trapped in the body of a robot\Nmonkey is not as fun as it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, what's got eight\Neyes and lives underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.53,0:12:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not exactly in the\Nmood for laughs, Chimp Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something down there I think\Nyou guys might want to look at.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And there I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking you couldn't get any more annoying\Nthan you already were, Banana Breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.61,0:12:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, hands up for here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You have got to chill out! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.37,0:12:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say chill?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a\Nlook down there first?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The little monkey's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you something\Nto be scared about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my double monkey noogie attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.35,0:12:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's four at a big five.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.19,0:13:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We beat you freaks of\Nnature fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.05,0:13:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But we still have some unfinished\Nbusiness to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you creeps want from us? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.99,0:13:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing we've always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.59,0:13:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This bunch of wackos couldn't\Nduel their way out of a paper bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think we want to duel you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My associates and I have had enough gains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for us to take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.35,0:13:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why duel you when we can\Ntake your bodies by force?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.47,0:13:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This ought to keep these guys busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to blow this taco stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.73,0:13:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing won't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you piece of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect that from\Nthe penguin, did ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.67,0:14:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Witness dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.47,0:14:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Start your rust bucket. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.67,0:14:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Warn me when you're going to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not wearing a seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you learn the truth. What truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at\Nthe virtual projection
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,in front of you It's you and my stepfather
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he and I have a history as well.\NIt's Noah and Kaiba. But what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.21,0:14:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this thing mean\Nanything to you, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:15:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trick. This is a picture of my\Nstepfather. Your stepdad? With Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.91,0:15:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention to the show, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it will clear things up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.05,0:15:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He is my latest acquisition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.41,0:15:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Seto, and he and his\Nbrother will be coming to live with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's extremely intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You could learn a lot from\Nhim, and that's my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto will be here to\Nconstantly challenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My hope is that having\Nhim around the house
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.39,0:15:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,will motivate you to improve your studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.13,0:15:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, if I'm going to hand\NKyber Corp over to you someday, Noah,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.49,0:15:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to prove\Nto me that you have the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.77,0:15:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,intellect it takes to run a\Ncompany of this magnitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be disappointed, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite what you were\Nexpecting, is it, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.13,0:15:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I being stepbrothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.87,0:16:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Gozaburo's one true son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was always supposed\Nto inherit his empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You were nothing but another\None of my father's servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.89,0:16:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Brought in to motivate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only reason my father let\NRiff Raff like you into his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To train me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the story of how an orphan with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,no class became the\Npresident of Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the time has finally\Narrived for me to reclaim
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,my rightful position as the\Nhead of my father's empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.09,0:16:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I guess this means\Nthat you're out of a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, your story makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.61,0:16:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're really Gozaburo's son, how\Nis it that I never met you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.91,0:16:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer that, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's part two of my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.11,0:16:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Alert, alert, alert, alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have to cut this short.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:17:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back after I deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying here, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of the gang's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gaining on us! Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.35,0:17:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys won't quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.73,0:17:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.27,0:17:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still in one piece, Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.65,0:17:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so. Serenity! I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But soon all of your\Nbodies will belong to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, which of you two should I\Nchoose to take control of? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to have first choice, Lector.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going in size order, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So you choose last.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the most ridiculous\Nthing I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.79,0:18:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm choosing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your wings to\Nyourself until I say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for all this bickering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose a body and stick with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let me go first. Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to act quickly if we want to\Nescape into the real world. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.03,0:18:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.73,0:18:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Noah, it's not what\Nit looks like. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're not breaking my rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.49,0:18:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fool do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.23,0:18:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I can explain, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you all the chance to win\Nyour freedom and you all failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.11,0:18:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, you're all dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.85,0:18:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No one disobeys my rules\Nand gets away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:18:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.57,0:19:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you all right there, Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.71,0:19:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've never been better. Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.21,0:19:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the best news I've heard all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Those whips never stood a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the action never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.69,0:19:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This just doesn't add up. Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Could Noah's story about you being his\Nlong-lost stepbrother actually be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah's story is nothing but one big lie\Ndesigned to mess with my head, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The supposed conversation\Nhe had with Gozaburo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,would have happened over six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is when this was taken,\Nbased on the imprinted date.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah looks the same as he does now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't aged in six years?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.75,0:20:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yama!
